NAME: an if-else with an empty else
DESCRIPTION: the then-branch's JMP to the end would land on the next cell: the default policy's peephole removes it; see behtests/empty_else_peephole.beh
SRC:
(let (x 1)
  (seq
    (if (JN x) (MOV 7 flag) (seq))
    (JMP 0)
    (DAT 0 (store x))
    (label flag) (DAT 0 0)))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  JMZ.B  $_IFM4 , $_LET1 
  MOV.AB #7     , $flag  
_IFM4 
_IFF4 
  JMP    #0     , #0     
_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #1     
flag  
  DAT    #0     , #0     
  DAT    $0     , $0     